<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-North Q3 net profit more than doubles.</title>
<headline>RTRS-North Q3 net profit more than doubles.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended March 31 (A$ million unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit			 68.5 vs 40.2</p>
<p>    Net profit				 39.2 vs 19.0</p>
<p>Nine months ended March 31</p>
<p>    Operating profit			176.6 vs 124.2</p>
<p>    Net profit				 89.2 vs  51.3</p>
<p>NOTE: North Ltd is a base and precious metals miner and forestry group.</p>
</text>
